#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:3
#: 0417a507b943450d95e7bfc430c85441
msgid "晶格随机扰动（Lattice Perturb）"
msgstr "Lattice Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:5
#: ac4e177f0dbd43ba952b0c3cf45b42d6
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:7
#: 77fc4041dd5c4dbcbb555fc7216dc011
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:9
#: c09967866aec41e5826554f778e68efc
msgid "围绕每个输入晶胞随机改变三条晶格矢量的长度，并可同时改变三个晶格角。它适合补充近平衡晶格附近的随机样本；若需要指定方向和固定步长的系统扫描，应使用“晶格应变”。"
msgstr ""
"Randomly vary the lengths of all three lattice vectors around each input cell, "
"optionally varying all three lattice angles at the same time. This card adds random "
"samples near an equilibrium lattice. Use `Lattice Strain` instead for a systematic "
"scan with selected directions and fixed steps."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:11
#: bd5a69e6efc6481b9210eec9bf94a725
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:13
#: 3c4477b9f9a6409a9dbb2a504fcdbe8f
msgid "设最大相对变化为 $m$。程序为三条晶格长度分别抽取独立因子："
msgstr ""
"Let $m$ be the maximum relative variation. The program draws an independent factor "
"for each lattice-vector length:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:15
#: 92e9ad2feaea4524936326605cc0b81b
msgid ""
"\n"
"f_a,f_b,f_c\\in[1-m,1+m],\\qquad\n"
"a'=f_a a,\\ b'=f_b b,\\ c'=f_c c.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:20
#: 195626d3ad8c43db8c8838f394214f09
msgid "开启“同时扰动晶格角”后，还会独立抽取："
msgstr ""
"When `Perturb lattice angles as well` is enabled, the program also draws independent "
"angle factors:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:22
#: 60fd2a128622471b9b962c5857018c81
msgid ""
"\n"
"g_\\alpha,g_\\beta,g_\\gamma\\in[1-m,1+m],\\qquad\n"
"\\alpha'=g_\\alpha\\alpha,\\ \\beta'=g_\\beta\\beta,\\ \\gamma'=g_\\gamma\\gamma.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:27
#: 7f707ffa51cf41d3ab9d16d82ec7b303
msgid "因此界面中的 `4%` 表示每条长度，以及启用时的每个角度，分别最多相对变化 ±4%；它不表示体积变化 ±4%。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, `4%` in the interface means that each length, and each angle when enabled,"
" can vary independently by up to ±4%. It does not mean that the volume varies by only"
" ±4%."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:29
#: 75a1f3af794f4bb6b255e310fcb33c9a
msgid "关闭角度扰动且输入为正交晶胞时："
msgstr "For an orthogonal input cell with angle perturbation disabled:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:31
#: 112ca5ee500b433d925ee3926e2f3589
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{V'}{V}=f_af_bf_c.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:35
#: ccf5d34e5f8c40a9ae4daae349d12c91
msgid ""
"例如 $m=0.04$ 时，理论体积边界约为 $0.96^3V=0.8847V$ 到 "
"$1.04^3V=1.1249V$。开启角度扰动后，体积还取决于三个新角度，不能只由长度因子相乘得到。"
msgstr ""
"For example, when $m=0.04$, the theoretical volume bounds are approximately "
"$0.96^3V=0.8847V$ and $1.04^3V=1.1249V$. With angle perturbation enabled, the volume "
"also depends on the three new angles and cannot be obtained from the product of "
"length factors alone."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:37
#: b5167609239d431b829372d7afa8b06f
msgid "原子分数坐标保持不变，Cartesian 坐标随晶胞变形。输入晶胞的全局取向会保留，不会因角度重建而额外整体旋转。"
msgstr ""
"Atomic fractional coordinates remain unchanged, so Cartesian coordinates follow the "
"cell deformation. The global orientation of the input cell is preserved; "
"reconstructing the angles does not add an extra rigid rotation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:39
#: 1830c5de878d43fc9cd4a1a35ddd5c42
msgid "输出数量"
msgstr "Output Count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:41
#: 4000aa9f1d9144bd85d6ee1ab1dce3f7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“每个输入的输出数”为精确数量。若输入结构数为 $N_\\mathrm{in}$，每个输入生成 $N_\\mathrm{per}$ 个结构，则："
msgstr ""
"`Outputs per input` is an exact count. If there are $N_\\mathrm{in}$ input structures"
" and the card generates $N_\\mathrm{per}$ structures for each, then:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:43
#: 5f9440e66f6f41ce9711df24699398b3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{in}N_\\mathrm{per}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:47
#: 53a4b84650a5421e8f4c5e71b019d9de
msgid "例如 2 个输入、每个输入 50 个输出，会生成 100 个结构。若某组长度或角度会形成奇异晶胞，卡片会明确失败并提示减小扰动范围，不会返回零体积结构。"
msgstr ""
"For example, two inputs with 50 outputs per input produce 100 structures. If a "
"sampled combination of lengths and angles would form a singular cell, the card fails "
"explicitly and asks for a smaller perturbation range instead of returning a zero-"
"volume structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:49
#: 00445d63f7f7445588c39343b9e9ab32
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:51
#: 95a2cd3bfadb4739aa0635b30c7cb231
msgid "采样序列（engine_type）"
msgstr "Sampling Sequence (engine_type)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:53
#: 1cf2b20453ee4055b642a596ff33f490
msgid "默认 `1`。`0` 为 Sobol，`1` 为 Uniform。"
msgstr "Default `1`. `0` selects Sobol and `1` selects Uniform."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:55
#: 406d01cf0d344288beca6e0c8f616bc5
msgid "Uniform：各输出独立均匀随机采样。"
msgstr "Uniform: Sample every output independently from a uniform distribution."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:56
#: 91b38e3832c04c5cb8f6fc81aebd1396
msgid "Sobol：低差异序列，小样本时通常分布更均匀；输出数取 4、8、16、32、64 等 2 的幂时平衡性最好。"
msgstr ""
"Sobol: Use a low-discrepancy sequence, which is usually more evenly distributed for "
"small sample sets. Balance is best when the output count is a power of two, such as "
"4, 8, 16, 32, or 64."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:58
#: c3538d56c0eb42018281dcbd8ace91b8
msgid "两种方式使用相同的参数范围，且都严格生成指定数量。"
msgstr ""
"Both methods use the same parameter ranges and generate exactly the requested number "
"of outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:60
#: 7ea9316167f4438b9ddc018a97042175
msgid "最大相对变化（max_scaling）"
msgstr "Maximum Relative Variation (max_scaling)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:62
#: 78dec031c40a491d9644c0cceac802d7
msgid "默认 `0.04`，序列化时保存为比例；界面显示为 `4%`。每条长度的乘法因子范围为 $[1-m,1+m]$，开启角度扰动后每个角度使用同一相对范围。"
msgstr ""
"Default `0.04`, stored as a fraction and displayed as `4%`. The multiplicative factor"
" for each length lies in $[1-m,1+m]$. When angle perturbation is enabled, each angle "
"uses the same relative range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:64
#: d9e7b1ca0124436bad4fa373eca6b592
msgid "界面允许 `0%`～`20%`。建议先小范围生成并检查体积、晶格角和最近邻距离，再决定是否扩大。"
msgstr ""
"The interface accepts `0%` through `20%`. Start with a small range and inspect "
"volumes, lattice angles, and nearest-neighbor distances before increasing it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:66
#: 6f67f82341794db492f61256c059f195
msgid "每个输入的输出数（max_num）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (max_num)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:68
#: 2be25e4f7b244011bd68dc6e8beb7329
msgid "默认 `50`，范围 `1`～`10000`。它控制覆盖密度，不改变扰动范围。"
msgstr ""
"Default `50`, range `1`–`10000`. It controls sampling density without changing the "
"perturbation range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:70
#: dfc507454e2b4bf590b1b381b13dfbc0
msgid "同时扰动晶格角（perturb_angle）"
msgstr "Perturb Lattice Angles as Well (perturb_angle)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:72
#: acb471d394a04e23b548a88cb861bf69
msgid "默认开启。开启后同时改变 $\\alpha$、$\\beta$、$\\gamma$；关闭后只改变三条晶格长度，原始晶格角保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Enabled by default. When enabled, the card also varies $\\alpha$, $\\beta$, and "
"$\\gamma$. When disabled, only the three lattice-vector lengths change and the "
"original lattice angles are retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:74
#: fed7483886214634ba9d53a05b24c8d7
msgid "例如原始角为 $90^\\circ$、最大相对变化为 `4%`，该角的采样范围是 $86.4^\\circ$～$93.6^\\circ$。"
msgstr ""
"For an original angle of $90^\\circ$ and a maximum relative variation of `4%`, that "
"angle is sampled from $86.4^\\circ$ to $93.6^\\circ$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:76
#: 6fb6b9d407174c3489b0016e30868572
msgid "保持识别出的分子刚性（identify_organic）"
msgstr "Preserve Detected Molecular Rigidity (identify_organic)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:78
#: f30dd27bb5fd47eb9fc9d4d28681cbca
msgid "默认关闭。开启后，程序在晶胞变形之后恢复检测到的分子团簇内部几何，减少晶格缩放直接拉伸分子内键的情况。分子识别结果应结合具体体系抽查，尤其是周期网络和 MOF。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, the program restores the internal geometry of "
"detected molecular clusters after deforming the cell, reducing direct stretching of "
"intramolecular bonds by lattice scaling. Inspect representative structures for the "
"specific system, especially periodic networks and MOFs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:80
#: d4daa2c0f6954a8584f010138cd8f474
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:82
#: b9eb1d1845a140be809f950f3781ee8a
msgid "默认关闭。开启后显示随机种子输入，并使相同输入、参数和 seed 可复现。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, the random-seed field is shown and identical "
"inputs, parameters, and seed become reproducible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:84
#: e6996562b4854cfc92eb53898989d4a0
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:86
#: c6d863ab63014aec9f3c0ed256e80496
msgid "默认 `0`，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。seed 会结合单帧结构内容派生，因此数据集重新排序不改变该结构的结果。"
msgstr ""
"Default `0`, used only when `use_seed=true`. The per-frame random stream is derived "
"from the seed and the structure content, so reordering the dataset does not change "
"that structure's result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:88
#: 0a318c774b3841c783ace5ccf31fde65
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:90
#: 99af80ef181c4d5796f058e04e44ef81
msgid "补充近平衡晶格邻域"
msgstr "Sample the Near-Equilibrium Lattice Neighborhood"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:92
#: 3629713a60454253860f0a3ccfc3c59f
msgid "一个弛豫结构附近缺少晶格变化样本时，可先使用："
msgstr "When lattice variations around a relaxed structure are underrepresented, start with:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:94
#: 467e8fb626c54ca6bb3a74ddab7bdffd
msgid "采样序列：Sobol"
msgstr "Sampling sequence: Sobol"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:95
#: 4c0405b9521e42198a9cc9bd394068a5
msgid "最大相对变化：`2%`"
msgstr "Maximum relative variation: `2%`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:96
#: 18b45ed8ce814069acfb583f7e4695b7
msgid "同时扰动晶格角：关闭"
msgstr "Perturb lattice angles as well: off"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:97
#: 04a4c8f5154f4530aee6789a9824066d
msgid "每个输入的输出数：`32`"
msgstr "Outputs per input: `32`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:98
#: d4daa2c0f6954a8584f010138cd8f474
msgid "使用随机种子：开启"
msgstr "Use random seed: on"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:100
#: 131621932f744b5c97aaffd21198310a
msgid "这会为每个输入生成 32 个长度随机变化、晶格角不变的结构。生成后先查看体积分布和最近邻距离，再决定是否加入标注与训练流程。"
msgstr ""
"This generates 32 structures per input with randomly varied lattice-vector lengths "
"and unchanged lattice angles. Inspect the volume distribution and nearest-neighbor "
"distances before adding them to the labeling and training workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:102
#: fc864d64e4914912aaa8088f6010690f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellScalingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_scaling\": 0.02,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 32,\n"
"    \"perturb_angle\": false,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:118
#: 1830c5de878d43fc9cd4a1a35ddd5c42
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:120
#: 893d131dd0064b17bc19faa6228aa5c9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`LSc(max={max_scaling},{U|S})`：`U` 表示 Uniform，`S` 表示 Sobol。"
msgstr "`LSc(max={max_scaling},{U|S})`: `U` denotes Uniform and `S` denotes Sobol."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:122
#: d6dd08aaf7fc4f409d82e8ec1ef9957d
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:124
#: 18dbd52868614eca9cb5351f9390942e
msgid "**为什么设置 4% 后，体积变化会超过 4%？** 三条晶格长度分别独立变化；正交晶胞关闭角度扰动时，体积比是三个长度因子的乘积，而不是单个因子。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can the volume change by more than 4% when the setting is 4%?** The three "
"lattice-vector lengths vary independently. For an orthogonal cell with angle "
"perturbation disabled, the volume ratio is the product of three length factors rather"
" than one factor."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:126
#: 76a0081e7b4448d1a6171c6994cbe0a9
msgid "**为什么提示晶胞无效？** 当前长度与角度组合形成了奇异晶胞。减小最大相对变化，或关闭晶格角扰动后重新生成。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the cell reported as invalid?** The sampled combination of lengths and "
"angles forms a singular cell. Reduce the maximum relative variation or disable "
"lattice-angle perturbation and generate again."

#~ msgid "晶格扰动（Lattice Perturb）"
#~ msgstr "Lattice Perturb"

#~ msgid "`max_scaling` = `0.04` （4% 缩放幅度）"
#~ msgstr "`max_scaling` = `0.04` (4% scaling amplitude)"

#~ msgid "`perturb_angle` = `false` （先只看长度变化，避免角度扰动混入）"
#~ msgstr "`perturb_angle` = `false` (isolate length changes first)"

#~ msgid "如果改善不够，增大 `max_scaling` 到 0.06~0.08，同时换 Sobol 引擎覆盖更均匀"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If coverage remains insufficient, increase "
#~ "`max_scaling` toward 0.06-0.08 and consider the "
#~ "Sobol engine for a more even small-"
#~ "sample design."

#~ msgid "抽查最短键长：如果 4% 缩放后最短键比 DFT 参考键长短了 > 0.2 Å，说明缩放过大，回调 `max_scaling`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Spot-check nearest-neighbor distances. If a"
#~ " 4% perturbation shortens a bond by more"
#~ " than 0.2 Å relative to the DFT "
#~ "reference, reduce `max_scaling`."

#~ msgid "输入结构含有机分子但没开 `identify_organic` —— 分子内键会被错误拉伸"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The input contains molecules but `identify_organic`"
#~ " is disabled, which would distort intramolecular"
#~ " bonds"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 `0.04`。晶格长度的随机缩放幅度系数 `m`，实际长度会在 `[1-m, 1+m]`"
#~ " 范围内均匀采样。如果同时开启了 `perturb_angle`，角度也在这个相对范围内同步缩放。0.01~0.03 "
#~ "适合补近平衡声子区；推到 0.04~0.06 覆盖热膨胀；设到 0.08 "
#~ "以上时务必抽查最近邻距离，防止出现非物理键长。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.04`. Lattice lengths are "
#~ "sampled with factors in `[1-m, 1+m]`. With "
#~ "`perturb_angle`, angles receive the same relative"
#~ " scaling. Values around 0.01-0.03 target near-"
#~ "equilibrium phonon sampling, while 0.04-0.06 "
#~ "broadens thermal-expansion coverage. Above 0.08, "
#~ "inspect nearest-neighbor distances for nonphysical"
#~ " bonds."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值，仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。两个不同的 seed 会产生两组不同的扰动分布。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `0`. Random seed used only "
#~ "when `use_seed` is enabled. Different seeds "
#~ "produce different perturbation designs."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出全是相同结构或分布极窄。** `max_scaling` 是否太小（如 0.001）？或者 "
#~ "`max_num` 太小导致偶然均匀。先增大 `max_scaling` 到 0.02 以上，增大"
#~ " `max_num` 到 20 以上。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Outputs are identical or cover an extremely"
#~ " narrow range.** Check whether `max_scaling` or"
#~ " `max_num` is too small. As a diagnostic,"
#~ " try `max_scaling` of at least 0.02 and "
#~ "`max_num` of at least 20."

#~ msgid "**分子晶体输出中键被拉断。** `identify_organic` 没开。对于 MOF、有机晶体等，必须开启此开关，否则晶格缩放会直接拉伸分子内键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Bonds break in a molecular crystal.** Enable"
#~ " `identify_organic`; otherwise cell scaling directly"
#~ " distorts intramolecular geometry."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Sobol 和 Uniform 输出差异大。** `max_num` 较小时（< "
#~ "20）Sobol 覆盖明显更均匀。样本数 ≥ 50 后两者差异缩小。如果在意复现性，固定 "
#~ "`engine_type` + `use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Sobol and uniform outputs differ strongly.** "
#~ "This is expected for fewer than about 20"
